{"id":"exception","lemma":"exception","pos":"noun","rank":2546,"glosses":["exception","exception (interruption in normal processing, typically caused by an error condition)"],"ipa":"/ɛk.sɛp.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/Fr-exception.ogg/Fr-exception.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"exceptions"},"formAudio":{"exceptions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-exceptions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Cette règle ne connaît aucune exception.","en":"This rule has no exceptions.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"rule, regulation"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]},{"text":"L'exception prouve la règle.","en":"The exception proves the rule.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to prove","l":"prouver"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"rule, regulation"}]},{"text":"Toute règle a ses exceptions.","en":"Every rule has its exceptions.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"rule, regulation"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Il y a des exceptions.","en":"There are exceptions.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"Tu ne peux pas faire une exception ?","en":"Can't you make an exception?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}